OL,3,GNEWSAJunior school evacuated after
OL,4,Asecurity threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA junior school had to be evacuated due
OL,7,Fto what police described as a
OL,8,F"threatening email".
OL,10,FFirside Junior School in Hellesdon,
OL,11,Fnear Norwich, moved all pupils and
OL,12,Fstaff to Hellesdon High School, on the
OL,13,Fsame road, as a precaution following
OL,14,Fpolice advice.
OL,16,FWensum Trust, which runs both schools,
OL,17,Fsaid there was no immediate need for
OL,18,Fparents and carers to collect their
OL,19,Fchildren from the school.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
